ect":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","chapter":"structure-of-atom","year":2020,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 3rd September Evening Slot","timeAllotted":144000,"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"difficulty":"hard","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2020-09-03 15:00","question":{"en":{"content":"Consider the hypothetical situation where the\nazimuthal quantum number,\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.674ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 298 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, takes values 0,\n1, 2, ....., n + 1, where n is the principal\nquantum number. Then, the element with\natomic number :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"13 has a half-filled valence subshell"},{"identifier":"B","content":"9 is the first alkali metal"},{"identifier":"C","content":"8 is the first noble gas"},{"identifier":"D","content":"6 has a 2p-valence subshell"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"Under hypothetical situation, the value of l is\ngreater than n which varies from 0 to n + 1.\n<br><br>For n = 1, l = 0, 1, 2\n<br><br>n = 2, l = 0, 1, 2, 3\n<br><br>Elements follow the following electronic\nconfiguration\n<br><br>1s 1p 1d 2s 2p 2d 2f\n<br><br>Atomic number (Z) = 9\n<br>1s<sup>2</sup> 1p<sup>6</sup> 1d<sup>1</sup>\n<br><br>Atomic number = 6\n<br>1s<sup>2</sup> 1p<sup>4</sup>\n<br><br>Atomic number 8\n<br>1s<sup>2</sup> 1p<sup>6</sup>\n<br><br>Atomic number 13\n<br>1s<sup>2</sup> 1p<sup>6</sup> 1d<sup>5</sup> (half filled)"},"hi":{"content":"वह काल्पनिक स्थिति पर विचार करें जहाँ\nअजागमनीय क्वांटम संख्या,\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.674ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 298 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, मान ले सकती है 0,\n1, 2, ....., n + 1, जहाँ n है मुख्य\nक्वांटम संख्या। तब, परमाणु संख्या वाले\nतत्व :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"13 का एक हाफ-फिल्ड वैलेन्स उपखंड होता है"},{"identifier":"B","content":"9 पहला अल्कली मेटल है"},{"identifier":"C","content":"8 पहली नोबल गैस है"},{"identifier":"D","content":"6 का 2p-वैलेन्स उपखंड होता है"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"Txt0uLrhcklmhRd7XJjgy2xukf3hktvy","updated_time":1605176987,"permalink":"consider-the-hypothetical-situation-where-the-azimuthal-quan-jee-main-chemistry-periodic-table-and-periodicity-syfinszvzwmfhiuk","paperId":"jee-main-2020-online-3rd-september-evening-slot","topic":"quantum-numbers-and-orbitals","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["multi_statements"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2020-online-3rd-september-evening-slot","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","chapter":"aldehydes-ketones-and-carboxylic-acids","year":2020,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 3rd September Evening Slot","timeAllotted":144000,"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"difficulty":"medium","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2020-09-03 15:00","question":{"en":{"content":"The compound A in the following reaction is :\n<picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/jgy2xukf